					"nextDialogs": [
						220140802
					],
					"speakerTitle": "旭東"
				},
				{
					"id": 220140802,
					"content": "味道確實很好，食材之間的搭配也很不錯，不愧是卯師傅。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220140803
					],
					"speakerTitle": "旭東"
				},
				{
					"id": 220140803,
					"content": "但是，我總覺得這份菜少了一點感覺…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220140804
					],
					"speakerTitle": "旭東"
				},
				{
					"id": 220140804,
					"content": "是「噼咔」的感覺吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220140805
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 220140805,
					"content": "我也說不清…唉，我還是再自己想一想吧，卯師傅至少給我提供了一個方向。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220140806
					],
					"speakerTitle": "旭東"
				},
				{
					"id": 220140806,
					"content": "#謝謝{F#妳}{M#你}幫忙跑這一趟，這些東西請{F#妳}{M#你}收下吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220140807
					],
					"speakerTitle": "旭東"
				},
				{
					"id": 220140807,
					"content": "到底怎麼樣才能做出有新意的菜呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "旭東"
